@startuml
title Deployment: sample-gcp infrastructure

actor Browser

node "Firebase Hosting\n(Spark plan)" as Hosting {
  artifact "public/\n(index.html, app.js)" as FrontendArtifact
  artifact "/__/firebase/init.json\n(Firebase Web Config)" as ConfigArtifact
}

node "Cloud Firestore\n(firestore.rules: public read,\nseed-only create)" as Firestore {
  database "(default)\n(Standard edition, Spark quota)" as DefaultDb
}

Browser --> FrontendArtifact : HTTPS
FrontendArtifact --> ConfigArtifact : fetch /__/firebase/init.json
FrontendArtifact --> DefaultDb : Firestore API (WebChannel over HTTPS);\nunauthenticated, gated by\nfirestore.rules

@enduml
